UID:ganggang-10001786-1779906600-1779915600@ganggangcafe.com.au
CREATED:20260421T012136Z
DESCRIPTION:Trivia at Gang Gang. \n\n\n\nOn Wednesday night Quiz Meisters 
 come and host a trivia night for us. We’re talking pop culture\, politic
 s\, geography\, musical clues\, movie clues\, cryptic clues\, something fo
 r everyone!  Call us up to book a table inside if you’re keen to get qui
 zzy. A cancellation fee is charged if you do not show up to your booking 
 🙁 Otherwise you can enjoy regular service outside.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260421T012138Z
LOCATION:Gang Gang Cafe\, Shop 4/2 Frencham Pl\, Downer ACT 2602
ORGANIZER:Gang Gang Cafe
URL:https://ganggangcafe.com.au/event/wednesday-trivia/2026-05-27/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gang Gang Comedy - Joshua Khoury
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20260528T193000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20260528T213000
DTSTAMP:20260525T135528
UID:ganggang-10002048-1779996600-1780003800@ganggangcafe.com.au
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ganggangcafe.com.au/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/05/Screenshot-2026-05-12-at-9.53.55-am.png
CREATED:20260511T235537Z
DESCRIPTION:Gang Gang Comedy brings you the best comedians from around the
  country. This month we have the 2026 Melbourne International Comedy Festi
 val RAW Comedy National Final winner Joshua Khoury. Local supports will be
  clever newcomer Annie Niemas\, fresh and funny Sisi Ross\, and Canberra
 ’s favourite Anneli Cole. MC for the night will be the silliest man aliv
 e\, Chris Marlton. \n\n\n\nJoshua Khoury has performed his offbeat obse
 rvational humour around Australia and overseas. He even made it onto day
 time TV\, which really thrilled his grandma\, and helped to repair their r
 elationship. “Josh\, your dry humour is absolutely delightful\,” – M
 att Doran\, live on Weekend of Sunrise (not even that out of context!!). \
 n\n\n\n– Winner\, RAW comedy 2026 \n\n\n\n– Breakout Comedy 2026 \n\n\
 n\n“An excellent writer of quirky jokes\, serving up one hilarious gag a
 fter another” – Chortle UK \n\n\n\nDoors at 7pm for a 7:30pm show star
 t. \n\n\n\nTix $22 online Humanitix\, $25 at the door.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260511T235539Z
LOCATION:Gang Gang Cafe\, Shop 4/2 Frencham Pl\, Downer ACT 2602
ORGANIZER:Gang Gang Cafe
URL:https://ganggangcafe.com.au/event/gang-gang-comedy-joshua-khoury/
END:VEVENT
